         "step": 1,
         "text": "Let \\( u = - 5 t \\) and \\( dv = \\cos{\\left(5 t \\right)}\\,dt \\), so \\( du = -5\\,dt \\) and \\( v = \\frac{\\sin{\\left(5 t \\right)}}{5} \\).",
