         "rule_named": "integration by parts"
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "So the integral is \\( \\left[- t \\sin{\\left(5 t \\right)} - \\frac{\\cos{\\left(5 t \\right)}}{5}\\right]_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{15}} = - \\frac{\\sqrt{3} \\pi}{30} + \\frac{1}{10} \\).",
